WEBVTT

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:06.480
III... V...

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:10.540
They... sacrificed themselves for Kaito and me...

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.000
For me...

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.860
Yuma! Something's coming!

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:28.580
Wha-What is that?!

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:53.520
Yuma! Kotori!

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:58.030
Wha... What is this place?

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:00.880
It seems like a rift between worlds.

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:15.850
You're... Alito!!

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:19.020
Do you really think you'll go and leave me behind?

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:22.260
We haven't settled the score yet!

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:24.190
Alito!

00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:26.290
I don't want to fight you!

00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:30.100
When did you become a coward who can't avenge his friends?

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:34.240
That big lug must be turning in his grave, Yuma.

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:37.200
Then... You had Gauche...

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:41.540
He was spirited, I'll give him that. But he was no match for me.

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:45.910
Gauche was... He gave hope to the kids!

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.840
Hope?... Oh yeah!

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:51.120
I guess he <i>did</i> say something like that, didn't he?

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:53.840
<i>Still fighting?</i>

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.600
<i>Damn right I am!</i>

00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:58.100
<i>I can't let a little game get to me, can I?</i>

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:00.160
<i>On my shoulders...</i>

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:03.460
<i>I carry the hope of those kids!</i>

00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:09.060
But him and his hope? I've crushed it into dust, see?!

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:13.100
Alito... what happened to you?

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:17.400
Last time we passionately dueled, you weren't like that!

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:21.140
What are you blithering about? I'm me!

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:24.880
No. Once, you were just like Gauche.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:28.620
To countless children, you were surely a symbol of hope.

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:31.540
Are you talking about those ruins?

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:33.190
Precisely.

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:36.080
The myth cast upon those walls...

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:18.960
That very myth...

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:22.940
are you true memories! The memories of when you were a human!

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:28.680
<i>Alito! Alito! Alito!</i>

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:32.960
The hope you gave to them... was the same as Gauche.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:35.920
I... Gave everyone hope?

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:38.780
Don't be swayed.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:43.660
To you, merely an accursed past! Remember!

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:47.180
The hatred you felt at your death!

00:03:47.380 --> 00:03:50.760
That's right! It's because of that accursed past...

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:53.280
That I was reborn as a Barian!

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:58.260
This is my true form!

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:02.240
It's time to Duel, Yuma.

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:06.360
Alito! Stop! I don't want to Duel you!

00:04:06.820 --> 00:04:09.040
Are you still going on with that nonsense?

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.820
Fine then. How's this?!

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:21.920
Kotori!

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:23.560
Yuma!

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:25.020
Well?

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:28.540
Are we feeling a bit more inclined now?

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:32.740
Alito! Have you really become that twisted?

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:34.680
Yuma, Duel.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:38.280
As he is, whatever we say to him is useless.

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:40.340
Yuma!

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:41.640
Alito...

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:47.140
Here we go! Duel Disk, set!

00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:54.020
D-Gazer, set!

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:59.070
Duel!

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:04.650
WONDER WINGS, will you carry me...

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:09.890
...to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF!

00:05:17.470 --> 00:05:21.580
The Duel that decides our fate,

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:25.760
now, show me your [Heart] CARD

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:32.580
Words aren't enough to satisfy

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:36.560
the feelings I want to express.

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:45.580
Beside you, I've always been dreaming the same

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:48.830
Right now, with you

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:52.760
Oh - By facing each other,

00:05:53.090 --> 00:05:59.840
... to create a new future, let's Shining Draw!

00:06:00.820 --> 00:06:04.940
On WONDER WINGS, you carry me...

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:10.370
... don't let us ever untie our hands,

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:15.540
<i>Kattobing</i> from the sun...

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:25.120
... on to an even brighter world, TAKE OFF TO THE FUTURE!

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:36.250
Alito... I'll take the lead!

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:38.460
<i>The Shadow of Chaos: Yuma vs Alito
The Tenacious Gladiator!</i>

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:38.580
My turn! Draw!

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:41.960
I Summon Gagaga Magician!

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:48.630
Also, I special summon Gagaga Kid!

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:51.970
If I control a Gagaga Monster,

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.140
I can Special Summon it from your hand!

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:58.730
Also, when Gagaga Kid is Special Summoned by this effect,

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:02.230
It can become the same level as a Gagaga Monster on the field!

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:05.270
Level Up! Gagaga Kid!

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:07.940
Here we go! Alito!

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:12.240
I use my Level 4 Gagaga Magician and Gagaga Kid...

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:13.410
...and Overlay!

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:18.000
Using the 2 Monsters, I build an Overlay Network!

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:19.750
Xyz Summon!

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:23.540
Come forth, Number 39!

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:25.460
Aspiring Emperor Hope!

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:31.720
Then, I'll Set a card and end my turn!

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:34.640
You waste no time, Hope!

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:37.010
But today you'll find me...

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:39.930
A little different!

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:41.850
<i>This is...</i>

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.650
What the...What's this feeling?

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.860
Yuma, you can feel it too?

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:51.070
Yeah. It's like he's possessed... Like by a demon or something.

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:52.820
A demon...

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:54.870
Here goes, Yuma!

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:59.200
An accursed past dyes my fists pitch black!

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:04.210
The gates that my fists open... will be those of a black hell of sorrow!

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:07.460
My turn! Draw!

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:13.090
It's here! The card that'll destroy you!

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:18.060
I Activate Rank-Up-Magic The Seventh One!

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:20.600
What... That card is...!

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:23.480
This is the power of us Seven Lords!

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:27.310
This card takes an Over-Hundred Number

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:30.990
from my Extra Deck, and ignoring its Summoning Conditions...

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.990
Special Summons it!

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:36.530
Come forth, Number 105!

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:41.080
Burning Knuckler Star Cestus!

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:46.380
An Over-Hundred Number from the get-go?!

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.670
Don't be surprised just yet!

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:53.760
Now, The Seventh One takes an Over-Hundred Number on the Field,

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:56.340
Turns it into Chaos, and Ranks it Up!

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.760
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:08.730
Come forth, Chaos Number 105!

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:14.030
Thy form, truly the greatest champion
of the Burning Knucklers!

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:17.910
Burning Knuckler Caestus the Comet!

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:24.040
Impossible! An instant change into Chaos?

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:30.460
This feeling! I see! So that's what it was!

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:31.840
What's wrong?

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:34.170
I didn't feel it before,

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:38.720
But now that the world's merging... 
... with the Barian World, I can feel it for sure.

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:43.220
That's... A card made with the power of Don Thousand!

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:46.140
Don Thousand?!

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:47.850
Are you there?!

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:49.810
Reveal yourself! Don Thousand!

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:50.520
What?!

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:57.320
What is that thing?!

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.870
So you've finally noticed.

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:04.950
It has been a long time, Astral.

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:08.500
And you are Tsukumo Yuma, are you?

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:11.380
That's Don Thousand?!

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:14.170
So that's it! You controlled Alito and-

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:18.340
He... is one of the souls reborn

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:21.760
so that I could regain my strength.

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:23.260
What did you say?!

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:27.980
Tsukumo Yuma. If you must hate, then hate Astral.

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:33.440
The source of this conflict lies with the separation of chaos from the ideal,

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:38.150
The Astral World's foolish decision, after all!

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:42.950
The Astral World simply strove to reach a higher plane!

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:47.000
It is that which I am saying was foolish, Astral.

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:52.080
Order and disorder, Cosmos and Chaos! They are two halves of the same coin!

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:57.210
Even so, the Astral World challenged itself to a path that surpasses chaos!

00:10:58.220 --> 00:10:59.680
No matter.

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:02.510
For you see, I am grateful to you.

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:09.140
My chaos was uncomfortable with a world that was as isolated as the Astral World.

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:15.110
And it was you who gave me freedom in an open world!

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:16.440
What?!

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:21.030
The reason the Legendary Numbers yielded such great power...

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:25.120
It was because they were sealing away my power.

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:30.210
Even though the Numbers were not in my hands... Now that their seal has been undone...

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:33.580
My powers are coming back to me!

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:36.630
You're lying... If that's true then we-

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.340
Are you saying we willingly undid your seal?!

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:45.850
With your own hands, you've unleashed the chaos in Pandora's Box!

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:51.600
And with that, all worlds shall be engulfed in Chaos.

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:54.650
Astral! Tsukumo Yuma!

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:59.530
If you wish to stop me you are free to try...

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:10.250
I can't believe that we'd have to fight Don Thousand this early!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.670
No. That was just a fragment.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:15.920
This one's energy is nothing compared to the real thing.

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:19.760
Take this, Yuma, Astral!

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:22.510
I Activate the effect of Caestus the Comet!

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:26.350
Once per turn, by using one Chaos Overlay Unit,

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:28.850
I can destroy one of my opponent's Monsters,

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.680
And deal Damage equal to its ATK!

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.690
Begone, Hope!

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:36.520
Hope's ATK is 2500!

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:38.690
Take that much Damage!

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:46.620
Yuma! Astral!

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:50.410
I'm not done yet! Caestus can still Attack!

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:55.330
This is the end! Direct Attack!

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:57.580
Comet Explosion!

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:00.500
Yuma!
Right!

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:05.680
Alito! Our battle... Do you think I'd let it end like this?!

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:09.180
I Special Summon Gagaga Gardna from my hand!

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:14.140
When we receive a Direct Attack,

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:18.440
we can Special Summon this card in Attack Position from our hand!

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:21.820
In that case, I'll just have to obliterate that Monster!

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:27.700
When Caestus the Comet destroys a monster by battle, Damage equal to the ATK...

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:29.160
is inflicted on you!

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:31.240
You're done for!

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:35.040
I'll activate Gagaga Gardna's other effect!

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:40.000
By sending one card from my hand to the Graveyard, I can negate its destruction!

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:58.350
Yuma Life Points are at only 200!

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:04.530
I'll Set one card and end my turn!

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:07.320
Yuma...

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:09.160
Are you okay, Astral?

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:12.870
Yes. To think that he'd attempt a One-Turn Kill.

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:17.830
Well, since it's Alito, this much was a given!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.830
Yuma. What's so funny?

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:26.300
Nothing's funny. It's just... I'm glad, I guess.

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:30.050
Right now, Alito's under Don Thousand's spell.

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:32.760
So it's not the real Alito.

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:36.310
So I'm going to bring Alito back to his senses.

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:40.100
Are you saying you've figured out what to do in this Duel?

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:41.610
That's right.

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:44.940
If we beat the fragment, then Alito's definitely...

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:49.820
But Don Thousand's curse... Will it really be that simple?

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:51.450
I <i>know</i> that.

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:54.080
But we'll do it somehow for sure.

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:57.040
<i>Same answer as always, I see.</i>

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:02.080
<i>But, though it used to make me nervous, right now...</i>

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:08.880
<i>Yuma. I believe in it, in your power to believe in others.</i>

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:13.510
<i>That's right. We'll do it somehow.</i>

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:14.970
<i>If we don't,</i>

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:19.060
<i>The feelings of everyone who fought for us will be for nothing!</i>

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:21.190
<i>I'll make sure I...</i>

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.270
<i>...free you from Don Thousand, Alito...</i>

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:25.860
...Gauche!

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:26.940
What is it?

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:31.490
That's it! The Duel we had with Gauche in the Number's ruins!

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:37.080
Back then, Droite gave it everything
to bring Gauche's emotions back.

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:40.080
And then, her feelings reached him!

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:42.880
In that case, we'll do the same!

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:46.550
No, we'll give it even more and fight!

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:50.630
So you're saying that if it's a Duel, we can reach him, right?

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:52.180
Exactly!

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:53.510
Impressive.

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:57.010
Here I go, Alito!

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:59.060
My turn! Draw!

00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:01.190
I'll Summon Tasuke Knight

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:10.780
I Overlay my Level 4 Gagaga Gardna and Tasuke Knight!

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:14.990
Using 2 Warrior-Type Monsters, I build an Overlay Network!

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:16.530
Xyz Summon!

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:21.620
Come forth, sheathed in light!

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:25.000
Dividing the darkness, descends a shining king!

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:28.590
Heroic Champion, Excalibur!

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:34.050
Alito! Remember our friendship!

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:37.970
You and I were friends who enjoyed Dueling together!

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.060
I was your <i>friend</i>?

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:45.440
Excalibur can only attack if our Life Points are below 500.

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:47.520
It's time to Battle, Alito!

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:50.610
Excalibur! Attack Caestus!

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:54.820
And now!
I'll activate Excalibur's Effect!

00:16:55.110 --> 00:17:00.160
Using all of its Overlay Units, its ATK is doubled until the end of the Battle!

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:03.580
4000 ATK!

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:06.290
Cleave assunder, deadly Hollowed Sword!

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:14.930
How's that Alito! Remember your burning soul!

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:19.050
That's too bad!

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:21.640
Instead of taking Battle Damage...

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:25.940
I can Special Summon Burning Knuckler Bail from my hand,

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:28.270
and make the damage I would take 0!

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:32.940
In addition! Numbers can only be destroyed by other Numbers!

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:36.660
In other words, your Attack just now was pointless!

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:41.200
That attack wasn't enough to reach Alito?

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:44.660
I'll Set a card and end my turn!

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:48.420
Now...I'll finish you this turn!

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:51.500
Our life is only 200...

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:54.800
<i>But in our graveyard, from our last turn,</i>

00:17:55.630 --> 00:18:00.600
<i>we have the Tasuke Knight
that was sent from Excalibur's Overlay Units.</i>

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:05.430
<i>When we have zero cards in our hand, Tasuke Knight can end a battle,</i>

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:07.190
<i>And Special Summon itself to our field.</i>

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:09.690
<i>With this effect...</i>

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:12.730
My Turn! Draw!

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:16.700
I Summon Burning Knuckler Headgear!

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:27.580
What's this feeling?

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:32.790
I Overlay my Level 4 Burning Knucklers Bail and Headgear!

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:37.010
Using 2 monsters, I build an Overlay Network!

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:38.760
Xyz Summon!

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:43.560
Come forth! Numbers 80!

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:48.390
Armor accursed with a soul of madness!

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:53.270
Maniaclad Conquer, Rhapsody in Berserk!

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:57.570
This Number is...

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:00.070
A Number with 0 ATK?

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:02.450
Why go through the trouble for this Number?

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:05.120
It can't be!
That's exactly what I'm saying!

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:07.910
I activate Rhapsody in Berserk's effect!

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:12.380
Once per turn, by using one Overlay Unit,

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:17.420
I can choose Spell, Trap, or Monster Cards in my opponent's Graveyard,

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:19.930
And Banish all cards of that kind!

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:25.180
What I choose, are Monster Cards!

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:33.980
Did you think I'd forget about your Tasuke Knight in the Graveyard?

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:38.690
Did he read our moves?

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:41.990
Now there's nothing to protect you two!

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:45.780
I'll also activate Rhapsody in Berserk's effect!

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:50.290
Once per turn I can Equip it to my Monster,

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:54.840
And increase that monster's ATK by 1200!

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:03.430
I can feel it. Within that Number... is Don Thousand's power!

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:05.010
Wha-What?

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:11.270
Then are you saying that Don Thousand's power's given Caestus a power-up?

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:17.190
Astral. Behold! My power!

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:19.900
Go, Caestus!

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:22.240
Attack Excalibur!

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:25.280
Yuma!

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:27.740
Disappear!

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:29.700
Not yet!

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:32.710
I activate my Trap! Xyz Peace!

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:36.960
With this card, when my Xyz Monster is attacked,

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:39.000
that battle can be negated!

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:44.840
Caestus' Attack's been-!

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:48.810
And then, by releasing the Xyz Monster that was attacked,

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:52.060
2 Level 1 Monsters from my Deck

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:54.900
are Special Summoned with their effects negated!

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:59.520
Come on, Darklon, Kurivolt!

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:07.700
Stubborn brat!

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:10.660
I'll end my turn.

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:15.620
With that new Number, I can feel the spell on him getting stronger.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:19.500
Even so, we still have to keep going!

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:24.220
Is Don Thousand's curse stronger, or is our friendship?

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:28.180
But is there a card that can bring his memories back?

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:32.270
There is! We still have that card!

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:34.390
Lion Heart?

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:39.400
But that Number will be dangerous to us as well!

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:45.150
I know <i>that</i>! But that card's Alito's memories themselves!

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:48.950
The Legendary Number is Alito's memories.

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:54.540
And this Chaos Over-Hundred Number is Don Thousand's curse.

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:57.830
Can it be? Is that how it is?

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:02.380
Yuma, I've found it! A way to lift Alito's curse!

00:22:02.710 --> 00:22:03.670
What?

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:11.970
In the present, past and future,

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:16.390
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:18.650
'Til we can grab hold of them

00:22:18.690 --> 00:22:22.320
Challenge the GAME!

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:24.940
Let it go.

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:38.210
When there's a problem that can't be beaten,

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:43.420
We'll just try again.

00:22:45.340 --> 00:22:49.340
You keep holding your heart inside your chest

00:22:49.340 --> 00:22:54.680
It's the power you get from keeping the faith.

00:22:54.810 --> 00:22:59.520
Even while you're discouraged and crying

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:05.400
Let's try to secure tomorrow with our bonds

00:23:05.690 --> 00:23:07.570
We can shatter anything

00:23:07.570 --> 00:23:11.950
Fear and fate and even the most fervent fantasies

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:15.830
Keep on burning as you break through!

00:23:15.910 --> 00:23:17.580
In the Present, Past and Future

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:22.040
We are wishing upon the shards of dreams

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:24.170
Let's go and reach out

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:27.010
Beyond the limits

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:29.420
'Til we can grab hold of them,

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:32.930
Challenge the GAME

00:23:40.850 --> 00:23:43.860
Don Thousand's spell torments Alito.

00:23:44.440 --> 00:23:48.190
Having found a way to bring Alito back in our Duel,

00:23:48.280 --> 00:23:51.320
We put our faith in the key to victory, Lion Heart!

00:23:51.450 --> 00:23:53.620
Everything lies on the next draw!

00:23:53.660 --> 00:23:55.410
Have his memories been warped?!

00:23:55.450 --> 00:23:57.370
Caestus is evolving again?!

00:23:57.540 --> 00:24:00.330
Don the garbs of the king, Lion Heart!

00:24:00.460 --> 00:24:02.580
Next time! Yu Gi Oh ZEXAL II!

00:24:02.620 --> 00:24:05.590
Fists of Awakening! Time for Alito's Revival!

00:24:06.130 --> 00:24:08.920
Break free of the spell! Alito!!!
